<PageLayout title="Editorial Policy" description="Our source standards, fact-checking process, update schedule, corrections policy and how we use AI tools when making prompts and tutorials." updated="2026-11-01">
  <h2>Source standards</h2>
  <p>We use primary sources: AI providers' official pricing pages and documentation, and official statistics such as the U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics. Prices we cannot confirm on an official page are not published. Every tutorial lists its sources, and every source link is checked before publishing.</p>
  <h2>Fact-checking</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Each price in a tutorial is compared with the provider's official page, written as plain text with a link, and dated.</li>
    <li>Worked examples are recalculated by hand.</li>
    <li>Each prompt is run in at least one listed tool, and its variables are checked against the prompt text automatically at build time.</li>
    <li>Example images are generated by us and labelled with how they were made.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>Use of AI</h2>
  <p>We use AI tools to help draft text and code. AI is a drafting aid, not a source: no number is published because an AI produced it. Content is reviewed for accuracy and usefulness before publishing, following Google's guidance on helpful, people-first content.</p>
  <h2>Helpful content checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Who</strong> made it? Pages name the Editorial team and link to its page.</li>
    <li><strong>How</strong> was it made? Pages show sources, worked examples and the date they were last updated.</li>
    <li><strong>Why</strong> does it exist? To answer a real question or do a real job, not to fill search results. We do not publish near-duplicate prompts that only change a word.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>We re-check prices quoted in tutorials at least monthly. We review each page at least every 90 days. The "Last updated" date only changes when content changes in substance.</p>
  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>To report an error, see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Confirmed errors are fixed promptly and the page's date is updated.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>The site currently shows no ads. If ads are added later, they will be clearly labelled and will never appear between a prompt and its copy button, and will never influence content.</p>
</PageLayout>
